| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: hits.SearchPhrase                                                                                                              |
|               |   Sort: to_timestamp(hits.EventTime) ASC NULLS LAST, hits.SearchPhrase ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=10                                            |
|               |     Projection: hits.SearchPhrase, hits.EventTime                                                                                          |
|               |       Filter: hits.SearchPhrase != LargeBinary("")                                                                                         |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[EventTime, SearchPhrase], partial_filters=[hits.SearchPhrase != LargeBinary("")]                       |
