|               |   SortPreservingMergeExec: [to_timestamp(EventTime@1) ASC NULLS LAST, SearchPhrase@0 ASC NULLS LAST], fetch=10                             |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[to_timestamp(EventTime@1) ASC NULLS LAST, SearchPhrase@0 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true] |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[SearchPhrase@1 as SearchPhrase, EventTime@0 as EventTime]                                                      |
|               |         FilterExec: SearchPhrase@1 !=                                                                                                      |
|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(16), input_partitions=1                                                            |
|               |             SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                             |
|               |               FallbackOnZeroResultsScanExec                                                                                                |
|               |                 CayenneAccelerationExec                                                                                                    |
